---
title: Release pipeline Saga flow (ADR 0001)
---
flowchart TD
    Start["Ordered release steps"] --> Check["step.check()"]
    Check -->|ready| Execute["step.execute()"]
    Check -->|reason or exception| CheckFail["Stop before this step runs"]
    Execute -->|success| Complete["Mark step completed"]
    Execute -->|failure| ExecuteFail["Rollback failing step first"]
    Complete --> Next["Continue to next step"]
    Complete -.-> Track["Multi-effect steps track partial progress on self"]
    CheckFail --> UndoDone["Rollback previously completed steps in reverse order"]
    ExecuteFail --> UndoDone
    UndoDone --> BestEffort["Keep rolling back even if one rollback warns"]
    Next --> Tail["Place irreversible steps last\nfor example: PyPI publish"]
